          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: беременность",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "беременность (berémennost) — \"pregnancy\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Во время беременности она много гуляла. Vo vrémya berémennosti oná mnógo gulyála. During her pregnancy she walked a lot."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Feminine."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "беременность (berémennost) is built on беременная 'pregnant', from the older беремя 'a load, an armful', usually linked to брать 'to take'; EtymDB has no entry."
            }
          ]
        },
