          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "роддом (roddóm) is a clipped compound of родильный 'birth-', from родить 'to give birth', and дом 'house'; EtymDB has no entry."
